the luxury German automaker faces increasing pressure from the works council and trade unions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Police raid chapters of Gremium MC biker gang</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ee0f422122c9e6d22380ee9a8c4e827929f306694fb60bf1c1d7836f1fbe72c</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T09:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-chapters-of-gremium-mc-biker-gang/live-79926275--65b7228f3ec1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-chapters-of-gremium-mc-biker-gang/live-79926275?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police in southwestern Germany launched major early-morning operations against a biker gang. The state of Baden-Württemberg is outlawing three of its chapters. Meanwhile, unions are planning more strikes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>VW scraps production modernization plan citing tough financial straits</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:578a2add35843bb95d9807dca4e9e109a6f8b163cfdcbf9a01d120999b5e062e</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T19:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/vw-scraps-production-modernization-plan-citing-tough-financial-straits/a-79923597--b06c676e46e8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/vw-scraps-production-modernization-plan-citing-tough-financial-straits/a-79923597?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">VW has announced that it will scrap large-scale modernization in light of its current economic situation. Employee representatives accuse leadership of putting short-term profits before long-term company viability.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cyber attacks and hybrid warfare: Germany gives sweeping powers to its police and intelligence services</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f9707d3a2a2f4b0edeff56934fd3e20f24ec21bdab5fa3aa4141fdd611aa0903</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:34:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T15:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cyber-attacks-and-hybrid-warfare-germany-gives-sweeping-powers-to-its-police-and-intelligence-servic/a-79941507--8b38eb9f8681.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cyber-attacks-and-hybrid-warfare-germany-gives-sweeping-powers-to-its-police-and-intelligence-services/a-79941507?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Drone sightings and cyberattacks have heightened security concerns. How are the police preparing to meet these challenges? And how do intelligence services plan to counter threats from both domestic and foreign sources?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Bundeswehr study exposes widespread sexual harassment in German military</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a3f5ca0f32f6e4f7615efb292273a59dafcf4638dd7ffa989e84dccbeaa3e22</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bundeswehr-study-exposes-widespread-sexual-harassment-in-german-military/a-79926359--0cec81791758.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bundeswehr-study-exposes-widespread-sexual-harassment-in-german-military/a-79926359?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sexual misconduct in the Bundeswehr is far more widespread than previously known, with younger women disproportionately affected. Defense Minister Boris Pistorius has called for a policy of "zero tolerance."</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Why the integration of immigrants in Germany remains a challenge</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3837a9e6681025a1396f5291810f698b1ea0cf16489df9443da49b96bbe9afaa</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T17:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-the-integration-of-immigrants-in-germany-remains-a-challenge/a-79923241--a319297bc2a0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-the-integration-of-immigrants-in-germany-remains-a-challenge/a-79923241?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Federal Office for Migration and Refugees has released a new Integration Report. It found that while the integration of people with a migrant background is improving, violent youth remain a problem.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Democracy study: One-quarter of Germans want a right-wing authoritarian dictatorship</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ac1a41556b96c78ec6ae1b97599faeacfca86d0e4fbd2889bc408f5eb07cbf2</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T16:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/democracy-study-one-quarter-of-germans-want-a-right-wing-authoritarian-dictatorship/a-79922718--e6377f13d887.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/democracy-study-one-quarter-of-germans-want-a-right-wing-authoritarian-dictatorship/a-79922718?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The far-right AfD's electoral successes point to a new trend in Germany: Prejudice, resentment, and extremism are on the rise. A new study suggests satisfaction with democracy is at a low ebb.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Wael Mohya could make German football history at 17</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be802f4fbe22400806003fdff8c383adf8ff7b793e01664687487bfe0ae129a9</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T15:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787--677b2c671ea6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At just 17, Gladbach forward Wael Mohya has earned his first Germany call-up. The dual-national talent has chosen the DFB path for now — and could soon make modern national-team history.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
